      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's completely understandable that you're feeling this way; the sheer weight of the world's problems is exhausting. When everything feels so bleak, it's natural to question the point of trying to make a difference. Maybe the \"point\" isn't in fixing the whole ship, but in finding a quiet, manageable way to make the journey *less* painful for yourself. Sometimes, the most immediate act of care is simply finding a way to take the pressure off, even if it's just for a little while.",
